flowchart LR
  subgraph Modern clock
    direction TB
    G[GNSS velocities now] --> RF[Rigid pole fit]
    RF --> RES[Residual deformation field]
    RES --> UNC[Uncertainty + calibration]
  end
  subgraph Geological clock
    direction TB
    ROT[Rotation model] --> REC[Reconstructed geometry at age t]
    REC --> LIM[Valid-interval limits]
  end
  SWITCH{{Clock selector}}
  SWITCH -->|present| G
  SWITCH -->|Ma before present| ROT
  NOTE[Interpretation links the two:\nnot a measurement bridge]
  RES -. geological interpretation .-> NOTE
  REC -. geological interpretation .-> NOTE
